Replaces: libgtk-4-media-gstreamer (<< 4.19.2)
Description: GTK graphical user interface library
 GTK is a multi-platform toolkit for creating graphical user
 interfaces. Offering a complete set of widgets, GTK is suitable
 for projects ranging from small one-off tools to complete application
 suites.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries, including the GStreamer
 media backend module (since 4.19.2 it lives here, and this package
 Provides libgtk-4-media-gstreamer).
 .
 This build has no X11 support: only the Wayland backend of GDK is
 compiled in. See README.md in the crick Debian backports repository
 for the consequences.

